==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|VS|Falkner's Togetic|5}} from the {{TCG|Pokémon VS}} expansion.
*'''Speed Dive''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Dive''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Golbat|39}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

